		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"title": "酒精",
			"text": "$(thing)基礎酒類$()不會為玩家提供任何增益。將各種水果、麵粉或其他材料和水一起放在$(l:craftsmanship/barrels)木桶$()中即可釀造。額外福利是：喝醉時，任何酒類都會影響你在聊天中的說話方式！",
			"item": "tfc:bucket/beer,tfc:bucket/cider,tfc:bucket/rum,tfc:bucket/sake,tfc:bucket/vodka,tfc:bucket/whiskey,tfc:bucket/corn_whiskey,tfc:bucket/rye_whiskey,firmalife:bucket/mead",
			"anchor": "alcohol"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"title": "熟成酒",
			"text": "$(thing)熟成酒$()是將酒在密封木桶內熟成3個月發酵而成。飲用熟成酒會提供效果。",
			"item": "tfcagedalcohol:bucket/aged_beer,tfcagedalcohol:bucket/aged_cider,tfcagedalcohol:bucket/aged_rum,tfcagedalcohol:bucket/aged_sake,tfcagedalcohol:bucket/aged_vodka,tfcagedalcohol:bucket/aged_whiskey,tfcagedalcohol:bucket/aged_corn_whiskey,tfcagedalcohol:bucket/aged_rye_whiskey,tfcagedalcohol:bucket/aged_mead",
