		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"title": "牛奶",
			"text": "當熟悉度夠高時，只要手持木桶或金屬桶對大多數母家畜按下$(item)$(k:key.use)$()，就能取得$(thing)牛奶$()。(如果沒有反應，請確認桶子沒有堆疊！)$(br)雖然牛奶不提供任何增益――也不會移除效果――但在進食後飲用可以補充$(l:cooking/food_and_water#dairy)乳製品$()營養。",
			"item": "minecraft:milk_bucket,firmalife:bucket/yak_milk,firmalife:bucket/goat_milk",
			"anchor": "milk"
		},
		{
			"title": "溫泉水",
			"text": "飲用$(thing)溫泉$()可以暖和4°C，泡在溫泉內會提供些微的生命恢復並讓你感到温暖。",
			"item": "tfc:bucket/spring_water",
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"anchor": "spring_water"
		},
		{
			"title": "海水",
			"text": "喝$(thing)海水$()不能補充水分，反而會讓你更渴。體溫過高也更容易感到口渴。在海上迷路了？下雨時抬頭看看就能輕鬆補水！",
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"item": "tfc:bucket/salt_water",
			"anchor": "sea_water"
		},
		{
			"title": "泥水",
			"text": "不建議飲用$(thing)泥水$()。這麼做會讓你噁心反胃，還會感染$(l:cooking/food_and_water#parasites)寄生蟲$()。",
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"item": "tfg:muddy_water_bucket",
			"anchor": "muddy_water"
		},
		{
			"title": "果汁",
			"text": "$(thing)果汁$()是將水果濃縮成保存期限更長之食物的好方法。果汁提供$(l:cooking/food_and_water#quenching_transient_effect)解渴效果$()，有助於抵禦口渴。$(br2)果汁會隨時間過期。$()",
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"anchor": "juice",
			"item": "tfg:food/juice"
		},
		{
			"title": "優格",
			"text": "$(thing)優格$()提供與牛奶一樣提供乳製品營養。可以與水果混合製作成$(item)水果優格$()。$(br2)優格會隨著時間推移而過期。$()",
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"anchor": "yogurt",
			"item": "tfg:food/yogurt,tfg:food/fruit_yogurt"
		},
		{
			"title": "果昔",
			"text": "$(thing)冰沙$()是一種強力飲品。它同時提供$(l:cooking/food_and_water#quenching_transient_effect)解渴效果$()和$(l:cooking/food_and_water#cooling_transient_effect)降溫效果$()，也是$(l:cooking/food_and_water#fruit)水果$()和$(l:cooking/food_and_water#dairy)乳製品$()營養的絕佳來源。$(br2)冰沙會隨時間過期。$()",
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"anchor": "smoothie",
			"item": "tfg:food/smoothie"
		},
		{
			"title": "液態冰沙",
			"text": "飲用$(thing)冰沙$()可以讓你降溫 4°C，最適合夏天！在穿越$(l:beneath/beneath)地底$()時也很實用。",
